Z||000000||trigger||09-25-2000||09:58 PM||||I was wondering what happened to the Monkeymobile.  You mention it once in a while.  If you don't want to say, that's just fine.  I'm just kind of curious.  Thanks.<P>Anthony<P>------------------<BR>Honestly officer, I was just keeping up with the flow of traffic.  I know there aren't any cars in the area, that's how far behind I am.||||reg||5
Z||000001||Monkeyman||09-26-2000||07:37 PM||||She currently resides in a cold, dark storage room on the other side of town.  (I know...I'm an unfeeling bastard.)  She's donated a few parts to the Grape Ape.  I wish I had the green to get her restored (she was my 1st), but I can't even afford to do much work on the Grape Ape right now.  Maybe someday I'll have the money to completely restore her to her original beauty (although I have no idea what that was--she was a little rough when I adopted her).<P>It would be nice if you could say a little prayer for her now and then.  I feel bad that she's where she is right now, but I can't have her at my house unless she runs.||||reg||1
Z||000002||trigger||09-27-2000||09:59 PM||||I was wondering what actually happened to make you stop driving it.  I know it would kill me if mine had to sit in storage, even though I'm not gonna drive it this winter.<P>------------------<BR>Honestly officer, I was just keeping up with the flow of traffic.  I know there aren't any cars in the area, that's how far behind I am.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Monkeyman||09-29-2000||01:55 AM||||She always had a slight oil leak (about a quart per week).  I went to Wendys (fast food) and when I came out, there was a huge puddle of oil under her tail.  I didn't have any spare oil with me (just checked it and used the last quart that morning) but I thought I could make it 6 blocks to the nearest gas station to buy more oil, then limp home.  I missed it by about 1/2 a block. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  Motor locked up.  Since she was in poor shape anyway, I decided that it wouldn't be worth the money to fix her up (yet) since she really needed a complete restoration.  (Most of her systems were in pretty bad shape.)  Someday...||||reg||1
